  "body_md": "**Subject: Upcoming Feature: Bulk Document Uploads**

We are pleased to announce that a new feature, **Bulk upload documents to a claim**, will be included in our next release bundle.

This update allows users to upload multiple documents at once to a claim, streamlining the process and reducing manual effort for claims handlers.

Please note that this feature is controlled by a feature flag. It will become available to your team when the release bundle is announced and your administrator switches the flag on."
}
